.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_send_associate_controllers" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_send_associate_controllers" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_send_associate_controllers \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Send - Associate Controllers (memory-based transports only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_send_associate_controllers
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 esubid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_ctrl_assoc_data *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "esubid" 12
Exported NVM Subsystem Identifier (ESUBID) of the target
Exported NVM Subsystem
.IP "data" 12
Associate Controllers data buffer, see \fIstruct
nvme_exported_ctrl_assoc_data\fP
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Send command with SEL value
NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_NVMS_SEND_SEL_ASSOCIATE_CONTROLLERS.
